#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:974
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_LadyGaveMePokeblockCase"
msgid ""
"Yippee!\p"
"The lady at the reception counter\n"
"gave me a case for {POKEBLOCK}S!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:979
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MakePokeblocksDifferentBerries"
msgid ""
"Make {POKEBLOCK}S and put them in there.\p"
"When you make a {POKEBLOCK}, everyone\n"
"has to put in a different BERRY.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:984
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_YourPokemonSpurredMeToPaint"
msgid ""
"Congratulations!\p"
"I did a painting of your POKéMON to\n"
"commemorate its victory…\p"
"Well, your POKéMON's appeals were\n"
"so fantastic, it spurred me into\l"
"painting better than I usually do.\l"
"Look, see?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:993
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ShouldITakePaintingToMuseum"
msgid ""
"What do you think? I'm confident in\n"
"what I've done, but do you like it?\p"
"A work of this caliber, it wouldn't look\n"
"out of place in an art museum.\p"
"Huh? An art museum really is looking\n"
"for paintings?\p"
"Do you think I should take this there?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1002
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_IllTakePaintingToMuseum"
msgid ""
"What, really? Then, sure, I will take\n"
"this painting there right now.\p"
"I'll give it a proper title, too.\p"
"I hope they'll like it and consider\n"
"exhibiting this.\p"
"Please check if they did accept this.\n"
"Thank you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1011
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_TakeMementoOfPainting"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's right!\p"
"As a memento of me painting your\n"
"POKéMON, please take this.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1016
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ReceivedARibbon"
msgid "{PLAYER} received a RIBBON.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1019
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_PutTheRibbonOnMon"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} put the RIBBON on\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1023
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_OkaySeeYou"
msgid "Okay, see you!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1026
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_TakeHomeButIdLikeToTakeToMuseum"
msgid ""
"Oh… Then, I guess I'll just take\n"
"this home with me…\p"
"But, you know, I would like to take\n"
"this to the art museum… Okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1032
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_FineThatsTheWayItIs"
msgid ""
"Oh, fine, that's the way it is.\n"
"I will hang this in my own house.\p"
"I'll just have to try harder next time.\n"
"Well, be seeing you.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1038
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MasterRankHereICome"
msgid ""
"Hoo, boy… Master Rank CONTESTS,\n"
"here I come.\p"
"The world will know that my dearest\n"
"POKéMON is the cutest being in all\l"
"existence. The time has come!\l"
"Uheheheh.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1046
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_WholeVarietyOfPokemonHere"
msgid ""
"You can see a whole variety of\n"
"POKéMON here.\p"
"That's why I make this place a regular\n"
"part of my daily stroll.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1052
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ContestFeastForEyes"
msgid ""
"Wow, coming out to a CONTEST is\n"
"a feast for these eyes!\p"
"Would you look at all the POKéMON\n"
"that just scream to be painted?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1058
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_ToughContestIsExtreme"
msgid ""
"The TOUGHNESS CONTEST is like\n"
"extreme, man!\p"
"Those muscular appeals…\n"
"Cascading sweat… I swoon!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1064
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_LavishedCareOnMon"
msgid ""
"Day in and day out, I lavished my care\n"
"on this POKéMON.\p"
"Its condition is peaking.\n"
"Today, victory is mine!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_ContestLobby/scripts.inc:1070
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_ContestLobby_Text_MadePokeblocksWithFamily"
msgid ""
"I made {POKEBLOCK}S with Mom, Dad, and\n"
"Big Sister. They turned out great!\p"
"I bet you can make smoother, better\n"
"{POKEBLOCK}S if you have more people.$"
msgstr ""
